  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "canonical",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open enrolment",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Deploy App, open <strong>MDM</strong> and tap <strong>Open for 2 hours</strong>. Do this before the transfer: a phone that asks while enrolment is closed is turned away until you transfer it out and back again.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b5d4bd107bb4855f.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Select the named phones",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>In Fleet, tick the named phones in your preparation team and choose <strong>Transfer</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/204f06c0dd5db585.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 290
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Transfer them to Deploy App",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Choose the <strong>Deploy App</strong> team and tap <strong>Transfer</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/80b224e7ffe15bee.webp",
              "width": 2128,
              "height": 1210
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Wait for the phones",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Within about 15 minutes each phone gets its certificate and appears here under its callsign. When all are in, tap <strong>Close now</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f696b94f6eeafb1a.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open Deploy App",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>On the phone, open the <strong>Work</strong> apps and tap <strong>Deploy App</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/84840932117af60e.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Chrome's first start",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The first time, tap <strong>Stay signed out</strong>.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0c9c55b572c71199.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Signed in",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Deploy App opens as the phone's callsign.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0e281f149b1dc049.webp",
              "width": 912,
              "height": 1804
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
